<%- include('partials/header') %>

<div class="container page-header">
  <h1>About <%= siteName %></h1>
</div>

<div class="container section prose" style="max-width:760px;">
  <p><%= siteName %> was started with one goal: help everyday shoppers make confident buying decisions without wading through sponsored hype or fake reviews.</p>
  <h2>What we do</h2>
  <p>We research and review products across tech, home, fashion, software, health and travel, then pair our picks with coupon codes and deals we've verified are currently working.</p>
  <h2>How we make money</h2>
  <p>Many of the links on this site are affiliate links. If you click through and make a purchase, we may earn a small commission from the retailer at no extra cost to you. This supports the time we put into testing and research, and it never determines which products we choose to recommend. Read our full <a href="/affiliate-disclosure">affiliate disclosure</a> for details.</p>
  <h2>Our editorial standards</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>We evaluate products on real-world usefulness, not just specifications.</li>
    <li>Ratings and verdicts reflect our own opinions and testing, not the advertiser's.</li>
    <li>We periodically re-check listed prices and coupon codes, though retailers can change them at any time.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>Questions or feedback? <a href="/contact">Get in touch</a> &mdash; we'd love to hear from you.</p>
</div>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>
